        "subject": "LU-20860 doc: clarify Test-Parameters and man4 placement",
        "message": "LU-20860 doc: clarify Test-Parameters and man4 placement\n\nRefer to lustre/ChangeLog for the supported kernels and distros rather\nthan naming the oldest one.  State that Test-Parameters lines only add\nsessions, and don't add testlist= lines for suites a full run already\nincludes, flag at_min.4 as a man4 page not to copy, keep the content\nof man4 pages shared by clients and servers in the page a client\ninstall keeps, and use a past-tense example for the problem\ndescription.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5\nChange-Id: Ifdf421c716d683bd1975416e0ed03d4aab3ebbe5\n"
